{
  "_comment": [
    "Frozen contract for @-mentions in message text. Three forms:",
    "",
    "  @handle   a mention: the handle is a message recipient, its herdr doorbell",
    "            rings once it is idle, and an engine handle is summoned.",
    "  @~handle  a silent mention: it names the handle (drawn as a member, found",
    "            by mentions:handle) and never wakes, addresses or summons it.",
    "  @!handle  an interrupting mention: a mention (it is in `mentions` too)",
    "            that also stops the agent mid-turn, when the sender may, so it",
    "            reads the message now. An idle agent is woken as for @handle.",
    "",
    "A token counts only at the start of the text or after whitespace, ( or <,",
    "so an email address is none of them. The backend (fastapi-backend/app/",
    "services/persister.py: parse_mentions, parse_silent_mentions,",
    "parse_interrupt_mentions) and the frontend (mycelium-frontend/src/lib/",
    "mentions.ts) each parse it; both assert every case below:",
    "fastapi-backend/tests/test_mentions_contract.py and",
    "mycelium-frontend/src/lib/mentions.contract.test.ts."
  ],
  "version": 2,
  "sigils": {
    "mention": "@",
    "silent": "@~",
    "interrupt": "@!"
  },
  "cases": [
    { "text": "@alice @bob do the thing", "mentions": ["alice", "bob"], "silent": [], "interrupt": [] },
    { "text": "@alice please review, cc @~bob", "mentions": ["alice"], "silent": ["bob"], "interrupt": [] },
    { "text": "@~bob only", "mentions": [], "silent": ["bob"], "interrupt": [] },
    { "text": "(@~bob) and <@alice>", "mentions": ["alice"], "silent": ["bob"], "interrupt": [] },
    { "text": "@a hi @b then @a again @~c @~c", "mentions": ["a", "b"], "silent": ["c"], "interrupt": [] },
    { "text": "@~bob and @bob", "mentions": ["bob"], "silent": ["bob"], "interrupt": [] },
    { "text": "mail bob@host.example or x@~bob", "mentions": [], "silent": [], "interrupt": [] },
    { "text": "@~ alone and @~-x", "mentions": [], "silent": [], "interrupt": [] },
    { "text": "@release-agent then @~build_bot", "mentions": ["release-agent"], "silent": ["build_bot"], "interrupt": [] },
    { "text": "@!coder stop, wrong checkout", "mentions": ["coder"], "silent": [], "interrupt": ["coder"] },
    { "text": "@!coder and @reviewer, cc @~julia", "mentions": ["coder", "reviewer"], "silent": ["julia"], "interrupt": ["coder"] },
    { "text": "@coder then @!coder", "mentions": ["coder"], "silent": [], "interrupt": ["coder"] },
    { "text": "(@!coder) x@!coder @! alone @!-x", "mentions": ["coder"], "silent": [], "interrupt": ["coder"] }
  ]
}
